TrUAPI native Chat v2 wire and cryptographic primitives

Derived from paritytech/polkavm-app-kit crates/useragent-chat-v2 at revision
57b236fe9e740c83d0ead3d22cc7ca5a85e4ad17, which mirrors the
paritytech/useragent-kit Chat v2 implementation, under AGPL-3.0-only.

This source includes native attachment wire codecs, bounded attachment
validation, and secret-zeroization modifications. The complete modified
implementation is maintained in this crate; no local Cargo override or
unpublished external source is needed to build the Host.

